# Internal operational notes — fleet topology, host roles, operator paths.
# The WHOLE directory, not one file in it: naming a single file leaves the rest
# untracked but not ignored, so a `git add -A` sweeps them into this public
# repository. legacy-amd-bringup.md, which names internal hosts, reached a
# public commit exactly that way.
.review/

# Agent skills synced in by revytechinc/skills sync.sh. Absolute symlinks into
# a developer's home directory; not part of the source tree, and this
# repository is public.
.claude/
